<p>Increases your golem's life, mana and stamina regeneration rates by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5">1.00, 2.00, 3.00, 4.00, 5.00.</acronym></p><p>At level 1, 3 and 5, the golem also gains a new rune slot.</p><p>Even without this talent, Golems start with three rune slots.</p>